                  <div class="section-heading">
                    <h6>How to play the game?</h6>
                    <h4>Game Overview</h4>
                    <div class="line-dec"></div>
                  </div>
                  <p>
                    Players use webcam on their laptops or iPads to control the
                    game. Players are supposed to play the game individually
                    trying to touch all the colored circles that are popped on
                    the canvas. In doing so, players have an exergaming
                    experience enabling them to move in physical space quickly
                    and rising their heartbeat.<br /><br />
                    The game is designed to make the players get off their
                    chairs, move around and have fun. Seamlessly integrate
                    dynamic movement into your workday through active gaming.
                    Say goodbye to sedentary hours and hello to an invigorating
                    experience that boosts your physical and mental well-being.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
